cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DL Flow Arrows in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DL Flow Arrows"
abstract: >-
  A QGIS Processing script that turns a terrain model (DTM) into a point layer of flow arrows - the fall line or the D8
  flow direction - with the catchment area of every point, computed the way SAGA GIS's Flow Accumulation (Top-Down)
  does. Drawn with one standard QGIS symbol; optional arrows as lines for CAD and Blender.
